      "english": "let's suppose carnal tongues speak praises about them: Whoever has performed above the measure of men through their conduct, and whose rightful actions were above the burden of those who bear flesh, with nearly no flesh on them—which carnal tongue can speak the praise of those ones? Those of this kind need the tongue of incorporeal people to speak praises about them,",
